WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Hey there, I'm Jacki and I'm an AI-native product designer
with a background in architecture and sales.
I got started in my design journey about seven years ago,
learning to love emotionally impactful, data-driven design.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:24.000
In the architecture world, I worked on commercial projects
like Google corporate buildings, educational projects,
and spatial design for the Apple retail team.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Later, as a high-ticket sales specialist,
I talked to over 500 people in 6 months,
converting over $100,000 in revenue.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Now, as an AI product designer, I work with startups
on AI workflow automation and chat experiences
in regulated spaces like health tech and fintech.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:06.000
I'm fascinated by design that's backed by data
and psychologically smart — drawing the lines
between design and code.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Time is the most valuable resource we have.
Any design that saves our time is worth our time.
Thank you for watching.
